turlash tilini o’rganadi, sun’iy intellekt yordamida o’z mini-o’yinlarini yaratadi, shaxsiy Telegram botini ishga tushiradi.\n\nBoshlash uchun oldindan bilish kerak emas – faqat qiziqish bo’lsa yetarli!\n\n1- Bepul darsga yozilish uchun hoziroq ro’yxatdan o’ting."}, "cta_type": "LEARN_MORE", "display_format": "IMAGE", "link_description": null, "link_url": "http://fb.me/", "images": [{"image_crops": [], "original_image_url": "https://scontent-cdg4-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/798281186_1620089033158701_3755799423165348244_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=_j3snq2vrF8Q7kNvwET07UW&_nc_oc=Adr1HWwjhIKrmxO0fnUOgB39QbCVEx8KZvyVqt2twDenKuRX6vQvHnKv3DY8CyvBF04&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-2.xx&_nc_gid=q2ufZ8MIsE7kEF-AZDZHmw&_nc_ss=7b289&oh=00_AQJNuF9TMGNdDRn05w2xLrzbtb99AEuy_tPxfSHMuyM5QQ&oe=6AB08E53", "resized_image_url": "https://scontent-cdg6-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/795480335_4428538910625312_8431522738887520906_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=uIN9I9JOMA8Q7kNvwE5JFgA&_nc_oc=Adp69ABK_qoDC2u3U1LF7aCduYeSWDHH0ciVBacAp2sKb851slkQEaOadjIuv3g9tAg&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg6-1.xx&_nc_gid=q2ufZ8MIsE7kEF-AZDZHmw&_nc_ss=7b289&oh=00_AQLbyuQd7KL0SJhCU26Mvq9N3Fcx_3MLJDFzLAM7LpxrCw&oe=6AB0AFE5", "watermarked_resized_image_url": ""}], "page_categories": ["Education"], "page_like_count": 13, "title": "Birinchi bepul darsga yoziling!", "videos": [], "is_reshared": false, "extra_links": ["https://t.me/sfera_academy_uz"], "extra_texts": [{"text": "Ma`lumotlaringiz faqat sizga aloqaga chiqish uchun foydalanamiz!"}, {"text": "Yashash manzilingiz:"}, {"text": "Qarshi shahri"}, {"text": "Qarshi tumani"}, {"text": "Boshqa viloyat"}, {"text": "Ismingiz"}, {"text": "Telefon raqamingiz:"}, {"text": "Phone number"}, {"text": "Условия и положения для Страницы Sfera academy"}, {"text": "Перейти к Политике конфиденциальности рекламодателя."}], "extra_images": [], "extra_videos": [], "country_iso_code": null, "brazil_tax_id": null, "addi