 bir savol o'ylantiradi: \"Bolam bo'sh vaqtini qanday qilib foydali o'tkazadi?\".\n\nAksariyat o'smirlar bu vaqtni faqat telefon o'ynab yoki ko'chada bemaqsad o'tkazishadi.\n\nAgar siz Qarshi shahrida yashasangiz, Sfera Academy o'quv markazimiz farzandingiz uchun ajoyib yechim taklif qiladi!\n\nBizning sun'iy intellekt kurslarimizda farzandingiz nafaqat kompyuter qarshisida vaqtini qiziqarli o'tkazadi, balki kelajakda yuqori daromad olib keladigan zamonaviy kasbning ilk qadamlarini tashlaydi.\n\n\"Bolam qaysi yo'nalishni eplar ekan?\" deb xavotir olmang.\n\nO'qishni boshlashdan oldin ularning iqtidori va xohishini aniqlab beruvchi bepul diagnostika darslarimiz mavjud.\n\nFarzandingizning bo'sh vaqti besamar o'tmasligini istasangiz, hoziroq pastdagi tugmani bosib, birinchi bepul diagnostika darsimizga ro'yxatdan o'ting!"}, "cta_type": "LEARN_MORE", "display_format": "IMAGE", "link_description": null, "link_url": "http://fb.me/", "images": [{"image_crops": [], "original_image_url": "https://scontent-cdg4-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/803005325_1639043797640166_2786013445121501999_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=3i6MRXKIPjUQ7kNvwF15uG-&_nc_oc=AdqkONor0V2b2rG5QQ4qyUh3A4YjDEVMbJkHgh2YF1vr_z_pYx11qusnWGLr87aIpoM&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-1.xx&_nc_gid=q2ufZ8MIsE7kEF-AZDZHmw&_nc_ss=7b289&oh=00_AQI5U5ePbX3SEyqaTSXoUSHCCLl9VskhMHxVAmTL_uRSvA&oe=6AB0A4CF", "resized_image_url": "https://scontent-cdg4-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/803328783_1549503479772920_3875639825617674058_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=K3vM3CAIzcgQ7kNvwFjPuiK&_nc_oc=Adr0WNLlJKyV3eWJwdOyPBQUQJFgYT4BRhY2FA-rSzJOkYSE1LUvDMH1klakZ9X0dLk&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-2.xx&_nc_gid=q2ufZ8MIsE7kEF-AZDZHmw&_nc_ss=7b289&oh=00_AQJyXgwb6nzca_REFKWOGnIHE9XfEgbd9ZIWBsNINImjng&oe=6AB0858C", "watermarked_resized_image_url": ""}], "page_categories": ["Education"], "page_like_count": 13, "title": "Birinchi bepul darsga yoziling!", "videos": [], "is_reshared": fa